{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strange Seed is a creature evolution game inspired by games like E.V.O.: Search for Eden and Spore\u2019s creature stage.\u00a0You begin as a humble blob: the \u201cstrange seed\u201d that fell from a very unusual tree. While many blobs exist, you\u2019re not quite like the others.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2463690/extras/659e6c3bd445db3b3a724afaa83b61e7.poster.avif?t=1768927221\" width=1170 height=452 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2463690/extras/659e6c3bd445db3b3a724afaa83b61e7.webm?t=1768927221\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Evolution</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat creatures to collect their DNA and unlock new body parts. Reshape yourself and experiment with combinations to build the ultimate form. But remember that balance is key: a strong torso and powerful head might win fights, but what good is strength if you can\u2019t catch your prey? With 7 part slots and over 40 creatures to discover, you\u2019ll have over 10 million possible combinations to play with.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2463690/extras/0a23c249955983e53a8f77887287de05.poster.avif?t=1768927221\" width=1170 height=519 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2463690/extras/0a23c249955983e53a8f77887287de05.webm?t=1768927221\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Exploration</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Venture through 10+ unique biomes, from lush forests and sandy beaches to cityscapes and even the heart of a volcano. Each environment brings its own challenges. Too big for a narrow path? Evolve into something smaller. Stuck at a platform you can\u2019t reach? Grow wings and take to the air. The world is full of secrets; can you uncover them all?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2463690/extras/2696095b81246915a0112dcf9ac9f3d7.poster.avif?t=1768927221\" width=1170 height=519 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2463690/extras/2696095b81246915a0112dcf9ac9f3d7.webm?t=1768927221\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Combat</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don\u2019t let the colorful world fool you - Strange Seed is full of danger. Creatures range from simple lizards to ferocious, Soulslike bosses. And victory isn\u2019t just about reflexes: the right combination of parts could be the difference between survival and defeat. If you\u2019re clever enough, you might even find ways to cheese your way to victory!</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Fully Formed","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2463690/a2f980476cf8a1b8855685e19a49c240b5ea7c25.jpg"},{"name":"Multi-talented","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2463690/a2f980476cf8a1b8855685e19a49c240b5ea7c25.jpg"},{"name":"Pure Descendent","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2463690/a2f980476cf8a1b8855685e19a49c240b5ea7c25.jpg"},{"name":"Genetic Pilgrim","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2463690/a2f980476cf8a1b8855685e19a49c240b5ea7c25.jpg"},{"name":"Bad Seed","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2463690/a2f980476cf8a1b8855685e19a49c240b5ea7c25.jpg"},{"name":"Really Bad Seed","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2463690/a2f980476cf8a1b8855685e19a49c240b5ea7c25.jpg"},{"name":"Savior","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2463690/a2f980476cf8a1b8855685e19a49c240b5ea7c25.jpg"},{"name":"Evolved For Land","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2463690/a2f980476cf8a1b8855685e19a49c240b5ea7c25.jpg"},{"name":"Avian Breed","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2463690/a2f980476cf8a1b8855685e19a49c240b5ea7c25.jpg"},{"name":"Specialized Evolution","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2463690/a2f980476cf8a1b8855685e19a49c240b5ea7c25.jpg"}],"total":43},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2463690?t=1768927221","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2463690?t=1768927221","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2463690/ff015765e897565a0790d884d30e224eba28c0b0/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768927221","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2463690/ff015765e897565a0790d884d30e224eba28c0b0/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768927221","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3224660,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strange Seed is a creature evolution gam